{
  "changelog": "Initial release of geoskill-geodatabase-management.\n\n- Supports creating tables, importing vector features, building spatial indexes, and running spatial queries in GeoPackage format.\n- Implements R-tree spatial indexing using SQLite\u2019s built-in rtree virtual table, no GDAL extension required.\n- Provides both indexed (R-tree) and brute-force spatial query modes, ensuring result consistency.\n- Offers inspection of layers, feature counts, and index status directly from the GeoPackage.\n- Includes offline, synthetic data generation mode.\n- All processing and data management run fully offline; user data is never uploaded.",
